     pptthhrreeaadd__ggeettccoonnccuurrrreennccyy() function always returns the concurrency level
     set by a previous call to pptthhrreeaadd__sseettccoonnccuurrrreennccyy().  If the
     pptthhrreeaadd__sseettccoonnccuurrrreennccyy() function has never been called,
     pptthhrreeaadd__ggeettccoonnccuurrrreennccyy() returns zero.

